  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Alt\u0131l\u0131s\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nSorumlu oldu\u011Fun, hizmet etti\u011Fin, emek verdi\u011Fin
    ancak seni anlamayan insanlarla muhatap olmu\u015Fsun. U\u011Fra\u015F\u0131p
    didindi\u011Fin ve u\u011Fruna kendinden dahi tavizler verdi\u011Fin konularda
    kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131k bulamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n gibi, iyi niyetlerin hi\xE7e
    say\u0131lm\u0131\u015F {{isim}}. Se\xE7ti\u011Fin kart, yat\u0131r\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131
    do\u011Fru ki\u015Filere yapmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Belki
    de sana kar\u015F\u0131 bir pozitif ayr\u0131mc\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131 bile
    hak etti\u011Fin durumlarda ikinci plana at\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6rmek seni derinden incitmi\u015F. T\xFCm bunlara ra\u011Fmen fevri reaksiyonlar
    vermemi\u015F, do\u011Fru zaman\u0131 beklemi\u015F, sabretmi\u015F ve pusuya
    yatm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Elindeki belki de bir at\u0131ml\u0131k kur\u015Funu,
    herkese ders olsun diye en do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde harcad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum."
